{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Behold, your days draw near to die</b> Said Moses our teacher, peace be upon him: Master of all the world, with this expression of Your praise that I said, \"Behold, to YHWH your Elohim belong the heavens\" etc. (Deuteronomy 10:14), by this You announce my death to me. The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: Did you not say, \"And they will not believe me\" (Exodus 4:1)? And likewise it is written, \"Because you did not believe in Me\" (Numbers 20:12)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:10.565127495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}